      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "A freight truck is a vehicle that transports goods from one place to another. The truck's body is built around a strong chassis and a powerful engine to easily carry heavier loads. They usually transport cargo between warehouses, factories, wholesalers, and retailers. Freight shipping is the process of moving goods from one location to another via air, land or sea transport. It can be used to deliver anything from high-volume raw materials, oversized objects to fine art. This cargo is often packed and shipped on pallets.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "货运卡车是一种将货物从一个地方运到另一个地方的车辆。卡车的车身由坚固的底盘和强劲的发动机组成，可以轻松承载较重的货物。它们通常在仓库、工厂、批发商和零售商之间运输货物。货运是通过空运、陆运或海运将货物从一个地点运到另一个地点的过程。它可以用来运送从大批量原材料、超大物品到精美艺术品等任何物品。这些货物通常用托盘包装和运输。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
